An indented comment block in a line block leaves nothing

```
::: |
  %%%
  secret
  %%%
:::
.
<div class="line-block">

</div>
```

```
::: |
a
   %%%
secret
%%%
c
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a<br>
c</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
    %%%
  x
    %%%
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;%%%<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;x<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;%%%</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
  %%%
x
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;%%%<br>
x</p>
</div>
```
